+    Returns the two-sided (1-alpha) bounds ``lower_two_sided``/``upper_two_sided``
+    (ranks floor((n+1)alpha/2), ceil((n+1)(1-alpha/2))) and the one-sided
+    (1-alpha) bounds ``lower``/``upper`` (ranks floor((n+1)alpha), ceil((n+1)(1-alpha))).
